,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":52,"created_at":"2025-09-04T15:56:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T17:40:04Z","closed_at":"2025-11-18T20:03:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110256","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110256.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110256.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-18T20:03:52Z"},"body":"Fixes #77246, Fixes #102081 and Fixes #70361.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the issue where a submenu would not open on hover until the mouse was jiggled. It also adds an additional delay to close a submenu when the mouse is moving to the right and goes across another submenu item. This provides time to reach a long submenu without it being closed by touching another submenu item.\r\n\r\n[Edit: The issue below went away after the push eliminating `minimum_lifetime_timer`. See comments below regarding probable source of the issue.]\r\n\r\n<s>There were several things confounding the issue, one of which is mysterious. In `_activate_submenu()` calling `submenu_pum->popup()` would intermittently fail, leaving the submenu invisible, even when `submenu_pum->is_visible()` shows as true. This is fixed by a `process_frame`, so I added a hack to do this, but I'm sure there is a better way. There should be a fix maybe in `Window` that would detect the incomplete rendering?\r\n\r\nHere's the line that can be improved:\r\n```\r\nsubmenu_pum->popup();\r\n// Unpredictably, some submenus won't show even after popup without a process_frame.\r\nget_tree()->connect(\"process_frame\", callable_mp(this, &PopupMenu::_activate_submenu).bind(p_over, p_by_keyboard), CONNECT_ONE_SHOT);\r\n```</s>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110256/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}